  "slug": "too-many-hobbies",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/4622_too-many-hobbies.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Xiao Yang is 8 years old this year and often makes his parents unhappy. He said he wanted to learn to draw, and his mother would take a car to school with him every Sunday. But after only two months of learning, he said that painting was not easy and he didn’t want to learn it anymore. He also said that he wanted to learn to sing, so his father invited a teacher to come to his home to teach him. Now that he has just learned it for a month, he says that singing is boring. I have too many hobbies, but I can’t stick to them. Now parents don’t know what to do. Are other children like this too?"
  ],
  "english_full": "Xiao Yang is 8 years old this year and often makes his parents unhappy. He said he wanted to learn to draw, and his mother would take a car to school with him every Sunday. But after only two months of learning, he said that painting was not easy and he didn’t want to learn it anymore. He also said that he wanted to learn to sing, so his father invited a teacher to come to his home to teach him. Now that he has just learned it for a month, he says that singing is boring. I have too many hobbies, but I can’t stick to them. Now parents don’t know what to do. Are other children like this too?",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Сяо́ Ян ́в э́том году́ 8 лет, и он ча́сто делает своих роди́телей несча́стными. Он ска́зал, что хочет учи́ться рисова́ть, и его ма́ма вози́ла его на автомоби́ле в шко́лу ка́ждое воскресе́нье. Но по́сле всеѓо двух ме́сяцев учёбы он ска́зал, что жи́вопись не лёгкая и больше не хочет её учи́ть."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Syaó Yan v étom godú 8 let, i on chásto deláet svoikh rodítelei neschástnymi. On skázal, chto khóchet uchítsya risováty, i ego máma vozílá ego na avtóbile v shkólu kázhdoe vzkresén'e. No pósle vségo dvukh méseytsov uchóby on skázal, chto zhivopís' ne lyótkaya i bol'she ne khóchet éy uchíty."
  ],
